{"id":51292,"date":"2026-05-16T07:35:57","date_gmt":"2026-05-16T06:35:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51292"},"modified":"2026-09-02T19:32:59","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T18:32:59","slug":"corrida-noturna-costa-da-caparica","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-noturna-costa-da-caparica\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Noturna Costa da Caparica 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Noturna Costa da Caparica 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A 10.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Corrida Noturna Costa da Caparica 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na noite de <strong>5 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), tendo como ponto de partida e chegada a emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Praia do Tarqu\u00ednio<\/strong>, na <strong>Costa da Caparica<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Almada<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>Xistarca<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Almada<\/strong>, a prova junta milhares de atletas para correr sob a brisa atl\u00e2ntica e a magia do luar.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa arranca \u00e0s <strong>20:45<\/strong> com a <strong>Kids Race 500m<\/strong> para os mais jovens, seguindo-se a principal <strong>Corrida 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>21:15<\/strong> e a <strong>Mini-Corrida\/Caminhada 5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>21:20<\/strong>. O percurso \u00fanico combina passagens pelo pared\u00e3o urbano e pelos areais da Caparica, culminando na tradicional e saborosa bola de Berlim na meta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 20:45<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; g